#ASSERT `How much of my weekly earnings counts question` `Part 3-5 (liability of manufacturers for goods with safety defects)` FALSE 4000 2000 EQUALS JUST 4000
#ASSERT `How much of my weekly earnings counts question` `Part 3-2 (consumer transactions)` FALSE 5000 2000 EQUALS NOTHING

-- s 87W(2): 6 hours a week over 6 months is enough; 5.5 hours, or 5 months, is not.
#ASSERT `Can I get damages for the unpaid care I receive question` `Part 3-5 (liability of manufacturers for goods with safety defects)` FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE 6 6 EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Can I get damages for the unpaid care I receive question` `Part 3-5 (liability of manufacturers for goods with safety defects)` FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE 5.5 12 EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Can I get damages for the unpaid care I receive question` `Part 3-5 (liability of manufacturers for goods with safety defects)` FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE 20 5 EQUALS JUST FALSE
