#ASSERT `What is the most per week for the care I receive question` `Part 3-5 (liability of manufacturers for goods with safety defects)` FALSE 20 2000 EQUALS JUST 1000

-- s 87X: 10 hours a week for a year, to a parent who could claim for loss of services: at most $500 a week.
