#ASSERT `Can I get damages for the care I can no longer give question` `Part 3-5 (liability of manufacturers for goods with safety defects)` FALSE 10 12 FALSE 10 2000 EQUALS `no: s 87X(2) is not met, so no damages for the care I can no longer give`
#ASSERT `Can I get damages for the care I can no longer give question` `Part 3-5 (liability of manufacturers for goods with safety defects)` FALSE 10 5 TRUE 10 2000 EQUALS `no: s 87X(2) is not met, so no damages for the care I can no longer give`
#ASSERT `Can I get damages for the care I can no longer give question` `Part 3-5 (liability of manufacturers for goods with safety defects)` TRUE 10 12 TRUE 10 2000 EQUALS `Part VIB's limits on damages do not apply to this claim`

